cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the conference paper below."
title: "Explainable Dysgraphia Index (EDI): reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Explainable Dysgraphia Index, a dysgraphia
  screening framework that pairs a ResNet-18 classifier with four
  occupational-therapy handwriting metrics weighted by Score-CAM activations,
  so that predictions come with explanations a clinician can check.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aadhavann/Dysgraphia-Detection"
